# Ensure consistent line endings (matches bouncerdata/.gitattributes).
#
# R/versebus.R is vendored from torpverse/torp and kept in sync by a plain
# file diff (see the header of that file). Without this, a working tree that
# checks out CRLF makes `diff` report all 652 lines as changed against an LF
# sibling, so the drift check reports 100% drift every time and gets ignored.
*.csv text eol=lf
*.py text eol=lf
*.R text eol=lf
*.Rd text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
